      "id": "claim_41d751c0585a487fbc4084ebeab52927",
      "statement": "All API paths are relative to the page (./api/...). The build has no configuration and does not know or care where the companion server runs. A build served at example.com calls example.com/api/capabilities; one served at example.com/v1.2/ calls example.com/v1.2/api/capabilities.",
