      "statement": "GET /api/library returns exemplars (code → Element Type family mappings) from OTHER projects for specified manufacturers. POST /api/library sends the exemplars harvested when a project opens. The server replaces the project's entire previous harvest (the whole truth) with mode='replace', or merges individual codes with mode='merge'.",
