      "statement": "GET /api/projects/<NUMBER> returns decisions a project's users made: ElementType assignments, local ElementTypes, code role rules, and code-pair verdicts. POST /api/projects/<NUMBER>/items sends new or updated items. The latest write for each (kind, key) pair wins. Supports incremental sync via ?since=<ISO8601> to fetch only newer items.",
