      "statement": "POST /api/projects/<NUMBER>/outcomes sends feedback about learned defaults: what was supplied by the companion, what the user's final value is, and the outcome (kept/changed/cleared). Sent in the background after staging or ElementType creation. A key is sent again only when its outcome changes. No feature depends on outcomes; it is pure feedback for learning algorithms.",
